        <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description>
                "The Ishikawa ontology aims to provide a data and view model to manage data encoded in Ishikawa diagrams which are also known as fishbone or cause and effect diagram (CED).\nIshikawa diagrams result from (iterative) workshops. Thus, the ontology includes the basic modelling of workshops to create Ishikawa diagrams."@en ;
