                  <dcterms:date>     "2013-07-02"^^xsd:date ;
                  <http://purl.org/stuff/rev#text>
                          "As its name suggests, this is more an abstract, high-level model than a directly reusable vocabulary. It's included here for its historical importance in the theoretical research around metadata, and the many questions it raises, many of them still in discussion. See http://wiki.dublincore.org/index.php/DCAM_Revision. Note that the namespace currently redirects to  \thttp://dublincore.org/documents/dcmi-terms/ which defines in a single document several DCMI namespaces (DC Elements, DC Terms, DC Type and DCAM)."
                ] ;
