                  <http://purl.org/stuff/rev#text>
                          "New version 1.1.0 - Added UNTP alignment - Material Provenance, Product Classification, Emissions Performance, Circularity Performance, Conformity Claims, Traceability Events. Initial release (1.0.0) with GS1 Digital Link alignment and ESPR (EU 2024/1781) support. Added properties: gs1DigitalLink, hasGln, hasGtin, granularityLevel, batchLotNumber, versionNumber. Added classes: EconomicOperator, Facility, CompoundIdentifier"
