                  <dcterms:date>     "2013-05-22"^^xsd:date ;
                  <http://purl.org/stuff/rev#text>
                          "The documentation page makes an exhaustive analysis and criticism of W3C calendar ontologies ical and icaltzd. This vocabulary is presented as a serious alternative, but does not seem to have been much adopted outside the NEPOMUK project."
